/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Gastric cancer is one of the leading causes of cancer-related deaths worldwide, with early detection being critical for successful treatment. This mini-project introduces a sophisticated Computer-Aided Diagnosis \(CAD\) system designed for the prompt and accurate identification of gastric abnormalities from endoscopic images using Convolutional Neural Networks \(CNNs\).)
