302 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The study utilized pre-trained models such as VGG-16 and InceptionV3, followed by fine-tuning on gastric image datasets. Experimental results showed a remarkable improvement in classification accuracy and reduction of false positives. The model effectively extracted both global and local features, proving the advantage of hybrid CNN-based architectures in complex medical imaging tasks.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
