305 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Park and team introduced an attention-based CNN model that focused on critical tumor regions in endoscopic images. The attention mechanism helped the network concentrate on highly informative image areas, improving detection precision. The model demonstrated improved interpretability and achieved superior F1-scores compared to baseline CNN architectures. The research concluded that incorporating attention layers enhances both performance and clinical relevance for automated gastric cancer screening systems.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
