311 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This systematic review analyzed over 80 recent publications on deep learning applications in gastric cancer diagnosis. The review summarized advancements in CNN-based models, dataset preparation, evaluation metrics, and real-time implementation. It concluded that CNNs, particularly when combined with transfer learning and attention mechanisms, consistently outperform traditional approaches in terms of accuracy, reliability, and scalability. However, it also emphasized the need for larger annotated datasets and clinical validation for practical deployment.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
