/T (SUMMARY)
/E (SUMMARY)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
313 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (From the reviewed literature, it is evident that CNN-based models provide superior accuracy and efficiency in detecting gastric cancer compared to traditional image processing methods. The integration of attention mechanisms, transfer learning, and explainable AI techniques further enhances diagnostic reliability and interpretability, paving the way for AI-assisted medical diagnostics in gastroenterology.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
